      "doc": {
        "summary": "One deferred vote on a cancellable event request.",
        "details": "Obtain a decision with EventRequest::Defer() during an event callback, keep it while awaiting a user response, then call Accept() or Cancel(). A decision can be resolved once, from any thread. Destroying an unresolved decision cancels the request; it never silently approves an unanswered confirmation. One cancellation wins over every other listener's acceptance."
